job: hold the gate.\n\n- A whole castle to defend: walls, towers, a keep, a market courtyard and a drawbridge over a wide moat\n- Ride the lift up to the lookout tower, jump up onto the ledge for a better shot, or walk out through the gate - it opens for you and nobody else\n- The Chrono Arsenal: 18 futuristic blasters on a weapon wheel - sidearms, rifles and heavy guns\n- Hold the trigger and every gun fires full auto\n- Wave after wave, each one bigger than the last - your best wave is saved\n- Captains, gate repairs between waves, a wave banner in the sky and a wrist board with the gate's health\n- Start menu, pause menu, how-to-play card and a soundtrack you can switch on or off\n- Smooth 72 fps with snap turning, played standing\n\nHow many waves can you hold?", "short_description": "Hold your castle against an army of charging knights! Stand on the lookout tower above the moat, pick a blaster from the future off your weapon wheel, and stop every wave before they break down the gate."}]}, "developer_name": "Citiview Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-castle.pages.dev/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://citiview-castle.pages.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SIN